cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AEGISS"
abstract: >-
  AEGISS (Atomic orbital and Entropy-based Guided Inference for Space Selection)
  is a semi-automated active space selection workflow for multireference quantum
  chemistry and quantum computing applications.
